{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13221400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13221400","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1322140001:1":{"text":"これが最後の戦いだ！平和と静寂へ続く、魂の戦いだ！","source_cn":"这是最后一场战斗！一场通往和平与宁静的灵魂之战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51220CB3C4CA407","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322140002:0":{"text":"集まれ、我が戦士たちよ！","source_cn":"我的战士们，集合吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEB9FD9E06A49BC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322140003:1":{"text":"ヴェリカ……将軍！","source_cn":"瓦丽卡……将军！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x427A7D176E465A7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322140004:1":{"text":"戦士たちよ、氷のカタストロフは封印された。我々はあの戦いで――勝利したのだ！","source_cn":"战士们，冰之恶魔已经被封印，那场战争，我们——赢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A8BF12A1C6BAC6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322140005:1":{"text":"勝った？\n……我々の勝利だ！","source_cn":"赢了？\\n……胜利了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38C9039E4CE0D90B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322140006:1":{"text":"今、私